    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: 'We are two members team(Wego & Scoz) from Taiwan. Normally, we use our
    leisure time(after work) to make games. Our goal is to make many kinds of good
    games and to entertain people. We expect we can engage in a full-time indie game
    team if we can afford it one day.



    In addition, if you are a game artist
    who would like to join us and focus on making games. No matter where you coming
    from, if you can speak English or Chinese, please feel free to contact us(scozirge2@gmail.com).
    We always share revenue from our games( but generally not much, just for fun)'
  UIString: P9_C1
  IsAddTextList: 0
